This is a Kotlin/Jetbrains compose project for quickly and easy record musical ideas. When recorded, the sample can be put in a database, consisting of mp3/wav files and tags can be added, e.g. punk, rock, ballad, 80 guitar solo etc. It is a desktop project but soubl be made multiplatform later on. 

Using a NavControl, some tabs are avalible: Recording, search and playback of already recorded and tagged samples, settings and settings for cloud storage.

For the structure of the code, the principle of separation of concern is important. We employ a Model-View-ViewModel pattern.